; ============================================================
; TITLE:    Polyspiral Gallery
; CATEGORY: Spirals & Curves
; LEVEL:    Beginner
; TAGS:     polyspi, spiral, recursion, angles, rainbow
; SUMMARY:  Draws six polyspirals side by side, the same procedure with six different turning angles.
; ============================================================
;
; WHAT IT DOES
;   POLYSPI is one of the oldest Logo programs: go forward, turn,
;   and go forward a little further next time. With only the angle
;   changed, it makes six very different pictures, from square
;   spirals to spiky stars. Each one is drawn in rainbow colors.
;
; HOW TO USE
;   Press Run. Then try  clearscreen polyspi 2 145 2 200  for a big one.
;
; CONCEPTS YOU WILL LEARN
;   * a procedure that calls itself (recursion), with a stop rule
;   * how the angle decides the shape: 90 square, 120 triangle,
;     144 star, and angles near them twist
;   * colors chosen from a list with REMAINDER
;
; THINGS TO TRY
;   * Find an angle that makes a spiral of hexagons.
;   * Use 89, 91, 119 and 121. Which way do they twist?
;   * Make the step grow by 3 instead of 2.
; ============================================================

make "rainbow [[230 40 40] [245 140 20] [240 210 30] [60 170 60] [40 120 220] [130 60 200]]

; Walk :side, turn :angle, then do it again with a longer side.
; Stop when the side gets longer than :limit.
to polyspi :side :angle :grow :limit
  if :side > :limit [stop]
  setpencolor item 1 + remainder int :side / 6 6 :rainbow
  forward :side
  right :angle
  polyspi :side + :grow :angle :grow :limit
end

; Draw one polyspiral starting at (x, y) and write its angle under it.
to exhibit :x :y :angle
  penup setxy :x :y setheading 0 pendown
  polyspi 1 :angle 2 150
  penup setxy :x - 30 :y - 135 setpencolor [80 80 80]
  label (word :angle "| degrees|)
end

clearscreen hideturtle
setbackground [252 250 245]
setpensize 2
exhibit -270 140 90
exhibit 0 140 120
exhibit 270 140 144
exhibit -270 -150 91
exhibit 0 -150 125
exhibit 270 -150 160
